  "_comment": "The concept graph (glass-pedagogy.md, 2026-11-07). One entry per concept a reader can learn and be tested on. `requires` lists hard prerequisites: concepts you need first. `taughtBy` names the walk lessons (lessons.json ids) that teach it now and `labs` the lab pages; a concept with neither is not on the site yet. `also` describes any other place that teaches it, with `alsoFile` naming that file so the test can check it exists. `coverage` is a judgment: covered, partial or none. `threshold` marks concepts that change how the rest is understood and get extra diagnostics. `objectives`, `misconceptions` and `levels` are filled as each concept gets its own page.",
